// Independent dependencies and their consumer can bind the same native C function without adopting each other's source names.
$ cd app
$ gti check
stdout: Diagnostics: 0 errors, 0 warnings
$ gti run
stderr: Diagnostics: 0 errors, 0 warnings
$ cp variants/conflict.gti src/main.gti
$ gti check
? 65
stderr: C symbol 'abs' has conflicting function signatures.
